OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Lights illuminate North
OL,4,AWest skies
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents across the north-west of
OL,7,FEngland have seen skies illuminated by
OL,8,Fthe Northern Lights.
OL,10,FThe pink and green hues were on display
OL,11,Fon Saturday evening.
OL,13,FThe natural phenomenon, known as the
OL,14,FAurora Borealis, is the result of
OL,15,Fincreased solar activity.
OL,17,FThe Met Office has said sightings could
OL,18,Fcontinue to be possible during clear
OL,19,Fskies across the UK until Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
